        "TileImage": "$($repository 809dc0fa-9eb6-4cd9-a9d0-3f3325204ecb).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47,\r\rWe got a Bonnie &amp; Clyde situation on our hands. Your targets are Madee Phyachai and Chutamas Preecha. On the surface - two peaceful bartende servants. A barkeeper and a waiter.\r\rHowever, as our report suggests, these two have a long history of poisening the Hotel guests with a dangerous substance called &quot;Alcohol&quot;. \r\rWe must put an end to this. Drown these two devils in the river, like their guests drowned in their drinks.\r\rGood luck",
